SpaRE: Controllable Molecule Generation via Sparse Representation Editing

This repository uses the Group SELFIES molecular string representation in its
data format and tokenization workflow.

Group SELFIES project:
  Repository: https://github.com/aspuru-guzik-group/group-selfies
  License: Apache License 2.0
  Authors listed by the upstream package metadata:
    Austin Cheng, Andy Cai, Mario Krenn, Alston Lo, and many other contributors

The Group SELFIES source code is not vendored in this repository. If users
install or use the upstream Group SELFIES package, its Apache License 2.0 terms
apply to that package.

